{"seq":1,"slug":"ledger-trace-flow-query","title":"账目溯源与账户流水","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/ledger-query-period-close/ledger-trace-flow-query","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"账目溯源与账户流水\">账目溯源与账户流水</h1><p>用户打电话来问&quot;我这 300 块钱去哪了&quot;，客服需要在一个界面上把答案点出来。这个动作对账本的要求是：从一个业务标识（订单号、退款号、结算单号）出发，反查出它产生的全部分录、这些分录落在哪些账户上、以及对余额的净影响。溯源能力不是加分项，它是账本能不能被运营使用的前提——没有它，账本只是一个漂亮的数据库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条溯源方向\">核心概念：两条溯源方向</h2><p>溯源有两个方向，它们用不同的索引、服务和不同的索引结构，不能混为一谈。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>起点</th>\n<th>终点</th>\n<th>主要索引</th>\n<th>典型使用者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务 → 分录（正向）</td>\n<td>业务单号</td>\n<td>全部分录与账户影响</td>\n<td><code>(biz_ref, entry_type)</code></td>\n<td>客服、风控、财务核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账户 → 分录（流水）</td>\n<td>账户 ID + 时间范围</td>\n<td>时间序列的分录行</td>\n<td><code>(account_id, line_id)</code></td>\n<td>用户账单、商户对账单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者在数据上是同一批分录，但访问模式完全不同。正向溯源是<strong>点查询后展开</strong>（先定位业务，再取其分录树），账户流水是<strong>范围扫描加游标分页</strong>（按账户与时间顺序读一长串）。用同一个索引去服务两种查询，必有一方性能很差。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  B[业务单号 ORDER-99120] --&gt; E1[分录 E1&lt;br/&gt;PAYMENT]&#10;  B --&gt; E2[分录 E2&lt;br/&gt;CLEARING]&#10;  B --&gt; E3[分录 E3&lt;br/&gt;SETTLE]&#10;  E1 --&gt; L1[行: 银行 借 10000]&#10;  E1 --&gt; L2[行: 应付商户 贷 9900]&#10;  E1 --&gt; L3[行: 手续费收入 贷 100]&#10;  L1 -.账户流水.-&gt; A1[ACC_BANK_MAIN]&#10;  L2 -.账户流水.-&gt; A2[ACC_PAYABLE_M88]&#10;  L3 -.账户流水.-&gt; A3[ACC_FEE_REVENUE]&#10;  L2 --&gt; R1[红冲 E4&lt;br/&gt;退款时]\">graph TD\n  B[业务单号 ORDER-99120] --&gt; E1[分录 E1&lt;br/&gt;PAYMENT]\n  B --&gt; E2[分录 E2&lt;br/&gt;CLEARING]\n  B --&gt; E3[分录 E3&lt;br/&gt;SETTLE]\n  E1 --&gt; L1[行: 银行 借 10000]\n  E1 --&gt; L2[行: 应付商户 贷 9900]\n  E1 --&gt; L3[行: 手续费收入 贷 100]\n  L1 -.账户流水.-&gt; A1[ACC_BANK_MAIN]\n  L2 -.账户流水.-&gt; A2[ACC_PAYABLE_M88]\n  L3 -.账户流水.-&gt; A3[ACC_FEE_REVENUE]\n  L2 --&gt; R1[红冲 E4&lt;br/&gt;退款时]</pre><h2 id=\"正向溯源-业务单号到分录\">正向溯源：业务单号到分录</h2><h3 id=\"biz_ref-的多对一映射\">biz_ref 的多对一映射</h3><p>正向溯源依赖 <code>biz_ref</code> 字段，但它建立的是一对多映射：同一订单号在支付、清算、结算各阶段各产生一条分录，退款时再产生一条。<code>(biz_ref, entry_type)</code> 组合在多数场景下唯一，但不总是——同一订单可能分多次结算，因此不能简单加唯一约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 正向溯源：按业务单号取全部关联分录及其行&#10;SELECT e.entry_id, e.entry_type, e.posted_at, e.period_key,&#10;       e.reversal_of, e.currency,&#10;       l.line_no, l.account_id, a.owner_type, a.owner_id,&#10;       l.direction, l.orig_amount, l.func_amount&#10;  FROM journal_entry e&#10;  JOIN journal_line  l ON l.entry_id = e.entry_id&#10;  JOIN account       a ON a.account_id = l.account_id&#10; WHERE e.biz_ref = :biz_ref&#10; ORDER BY e.posted_at, e.entry_id, l.line_no;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 正向溯源：按业务单号取全部关联分录及其行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reversal_of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">owner_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">owner_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">func_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line  l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account       a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">biz_ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :biz_ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询走 <code>idx_entry_bizref</code> 索引定位分录头，再按 <code>idx_line_entry</code> 展开行。为了不产生 N+1 查询（先查头、再逐个查行），必须用 JOIN 一次取回，或分两步批量取（头一批、行用 <code>entry_id IN (...)</code> 一批）。后者在分录行数很多时更可控。</p>\n<h3 id=\"溯源接口的三个必备返回\">溯源接口的三个必备返回</h3><p>一个可用的溯源接口要返回三样东西，缺一样客服就没法回答用户：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分录清单</strong>：每条分录的业务类型、过账时间、方向与金额。这是&quot;发生了什么&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>账户影响</strong>：每条分录落在哪些账户、每个账户资金增减多少。这是&quot;钱去了哪&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>冲销关系</strong>：哪些分录被红冲、由哪条分录冲销。这是&quot;为什么这笔又退回来了&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第三项最容易被遗漏，也最容易出事故。用户看到一笔支付和一笔退款，如果界面上不标注&quot;退款是对支付的冲销&quot;，客服只能人工推断。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 带冲销关系的溯源：用自连接标记每笔分录的红冲状态&#10;SELECT e.entry_id, e.entry_type, e.posted_at, e.orig_amount_total,&#10;       r.entry_id AS reversed_by, r.posted_at AS reversed_at,&#10;       e.reversal_of AS reverses&#10;  FROM journal_entry e&#10;  LEFT JOIN journal_entry r ON r.reversal_of = e.entry_id&#10;  LEFT JOIN LATERAL (&#10;    SELECT SUM(orig_amount) AS orig_amount_total&#10;      FROM journal_line WHERE entry_id = e.entry_id AND direction = &#39;DR&#39;&#10;  ) t ON TRUE&#10; WHERE e.biz_ref = :biz_ref&#10; ORDER BY e.posted_at, e.entry_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 带冲销关系的溯源：用自连接标记每笔分录的红冲状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reversed_by, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reversed_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reversal_of</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reverses</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reversal_of</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orig_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orig_amount_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DR'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">biz_ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :biz_ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>LEFT JOIN journal_entry r ON r.reversal_of = e.entry_id</code> 用上了 <a href=\"../double-entry-posting/immutable-posting-reversal\">不可变过账与红冲</a> 里在 <code>reversal_of</code> 上建的偏索引。这个连接同时给出了两个方向：<code>reversed_by</code> 说明&quot;这笔被冲了&quot;，<code>reverses</code> 说明&quot;这笔是冲销别人的&quot;，两个方向都要呈现给使用者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账户流水-范围扫描与分页\">账户流水：范围扫描与分页</h2><h3 id=\"游标分页而非-offset\">游标分页而非 OFFSET</h3><p>一个高活跃商户的账户可能有上亿行流水。用 <code>OFFSET 1000000 LIMIT 50</code> 分页在数据库里是灾难——它要扫描并丢弃前一百万行。正确做法是<strong>基于 <code>line_id</code> 的游标分页</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 账户流水：游标分页，cursor 是上一页最后一条的 line_id&#10;SELECT l.line_id, l.entry_id, e.biz_ref, e.entry_type,&#10;       e.posted_at, l.direction, l.orig_amount, l.func_amount,&#10;       b.posted_orig AS running_balance&#10;  FROM journal_line  l&#10;  JOIN journal_entry e USING (entry_id)&#10;  JOIN account_balance b ON b.account_id = l.account_id&#10; WHERE l.account_id = :account_id&#10;   AND l.line_id &lt; :cursor          -- 首页传一个极大值&#10;   AND e.posted_at &gt;= :from_ts&#10;   AND e.posted_at &lt;  :to_ts&#10; ORDER BY l.line_id DESC&#10; LIMIT :page_size;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 账户流水：游标分页，cursor 是上一页最后一条的 line_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">biz_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">func_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line  l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">cursor</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          -- 首页传一个极大值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :from_ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  :to_ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :page_size;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用 <code>line_id</code> 而不是 <code>posted_at</code> 做游标，理由与快照定界相同：<strong>自增 ID 严格单调，时间戳可能重复</strong>。若两行同一毫秒过账，用时间戳做游标会漏行或重复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"running_balance-的计算代价\">running_balance 的计算代价</h3><p>上面查询里的 <code>running_balance</code>（每行之后的账户余额）是一个诱人但昂贵的字段。它要么靠窗口函数现算（扫描范围内全部行，代价与范围大小成正比），要么靠快照倒推。</p>\n<p>窗口函数版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT l.line_id, l.entry_id, e.posted_at, l.direction, l.orig_amount,&#10;       :snapshot_balance + SUM(CASE l.direction WHEN &#39;DR&#39; THEN l.orig_amount&#10;                                                   ELSE -l.orig_amount END)&#10;         OVER (ORDER BY l.line_id ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW)&#10;         AS running_balance&#10;  FROM journal_line l JOIN journal_entry e USING (entry_id)&#10; WHERE l.account_id = :account_id&#10;   AND l.line_id &gt; :snapshot_max_line_id    -- 从快照点之后开始累加&#10;   AND l.line_id &lt;= :page_end_line_id&#10; ORDER BY l.line_id DESC&#10; LIMIT :page_size;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       :snapshot_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                   ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :snapshot_max_line_id    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从快照点之后开始累加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :page_end_line_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :page_size;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键在于 <code>l.line_id &gt; :snapshot_max_line_id</code> 这个起点：从 <a href=\"../balance-trial-balance/balance-snapshot-carryforward\">余额快照与结转</a> 的 <code>max_line_id</code> 起算，窗口的累加范围被限制在&quot;快照之后&quot;，而不是&quot;账户开户以来&quot;。这是快照机制在流水查询上的直接复用——同一个 <code>max_line_id</code> 同时服务于余额计算和流水的 running_balance。</p>\n<p>对超长流水，更好的做法是<strong>只对当前页算 running_balance</strong>，且起点是当前页第一行的前一行余额——这需要一次额外的单点查询，但把窗口范围从&quot;快照到当前页&quot;缩短到&quot;页内&quot;。这两种取舍按账户活跃度选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>每次查询额外成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快照起点 + 全范围窗口</td>\n<td>与快照后的行数成正比</td>\n<td>低活跃账户（快照后行数少）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页内窗口 + 前一行余额单查</td>\n<td>O(页大小) + 1 次点查</td>\n<td>高活跃账户（快照后行数多）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预计算逐行余额（物化）</td>\n<td>写入成本翻倍</td>\n<td>极少使用，除非强需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"溯源的数据完整性要求\">溯源的数据完整性要求</h2><p>溯源能工作的前提是<strong>分录携带了足够的业务标识</strong>。这是账本设计阶段就要定下的，事后无法补——历史分录缺字段就是缺字段，补不回来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个必须记录的业务字段\">三个必须记录的业务字段</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>缺失的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>biz_ref</code></td>\n<td>业务唯一标识</td>\n<td>无法从业务反查分录，客服只能靠金额与时间猜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entry_type</code></td>\n<td>业务动作分类</td>\n<td>同一 biz_ref 的多条分录无法区分阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>idempotency_key</code></td>\n<td>业务动作实例</td>\n<td>无法区分&quot;一单一次&quot;与&quot;一单多次&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 溯源完整性的自检：找出缺失关键标识的分录&#10;SELECT entry_type, COUNT(*) AS missing_count&#10;  FROM journal_entry&#10; WHERE biz_ref IS NULL&#10;    OR biz_ref = &#39;&#39;&#10;    OR entry_type IS NULL&#10; GROUP BY entry_type&#10; ORDER BY missing_count DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 溯源完整性的自检：找出缺失关键标识的分录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> missing_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> biz_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> biz_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> missing_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询应当恒返回空集。它值得做成定时任务，因为<strong>新加的记账入口很容易忘记填 <code>biz_ref</code></strong>——尤其是那些由定时任务或补偿逻辑生成的分录。一次漏填就会留下一批无法溯源的记录，而这些记录一旦产生就永久不可补（分录不可变）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"溯源与多阶段业务的对应\">溯源与多阶段业务的对应</h3><p>一个完整业务的生命周期通常跨越多条分录与多个账户，溯源查询要能把它们串起来。以&quot;支付 → 清算 → 结算 → 打款&quot;为例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant U as 用户&#10;  participant L as 账本&#10;  participant C as 渠道&#10;  participant M as 商户&#10;  U-&gt;&gt;L: 支付 100&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;L: E1 PAYMENT&lt;br/&gt;借 银行 100 / 贷 应付商户 99 / 贷 手续费 1&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;L: 清算到账&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;L: E2 CLEARING&lt;br/&gt;借 在途 100 / 贷 银行 100&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;L: E3 SETTLE&lt;br/&gt;借 应付商户 99(负债减少)&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;M: 打款 99&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;L: E4 PAYOUT&lt;br/&gt;借 应付商户 99 / 贷 银行 99\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant L as 账本\n  participant C as 渠道\n  participant M as 商户\n  U-&gt;&gt;L: 支付 100\n  L-&gt;&gt;L: E1 PAYMENT&lt;br/&gt;借 银行 100 / 贷 应付商户 99 / 贷 手续费 1\n  C-&gt;&gt;L: 清算到账\n  L-&gt;&gt;L: E2 CLEARING&lt;br/&gt;借 在途 100 / 贷 银行 100\n  L-&gt;&gt;L: E3 SETTLE&lt;br/&gt;借 应付商户 99(负债减少)\n  L-&gt;&gt;M: 打款 99\n  L-&gt;&gt;L: E4 PAYOUT&lt;br/&gt;借 应付商户 99 / 贷 银行 99</pre><p>四条分录共享同一个 <code>biz_ref</code>，但 <code>entry_type</code> 不同。溯源接口按 <code>entry_type</code> 分组展示，使用者才能理解&quot;这笔钱经历了四个阶段&quot;。如果全部标成同一个 <code>entry_type</code>，界面上就是四条不知所以的借贷记录。<strong><code>entry_type</code> 的取值集合要收敛成一个枚举</strong>（在数据库层用 CHECK 或独立的字典表约束），否则会长期漂移出几十个同义标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>溯源把账本从&quot;存下来&quot;变成&quot;用起来&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两个溯源方向用不同的索引与访问模式</strong>：正向按 <code>biz_ref</code> 点查询后展开，流水按 <code>(account_id, line_id)</code> 范围扫描。</li>\n<li><strong><code>biz_ref</code> 是一对多映射</strong>，不能加唯一约束；<code>entry_type</code> 承载阶段语义，取值必须收敛成枚举。</li>\n<li><strong>溯源结果要返回分录清单、账户影响、冲销关系三样</strong>，第三项最容易被遗漏。</li>\n<li><strong>流水分页用 <code>line_id</code> 游标而非 OFFSET</strong>，因为自增 ID 严格单调而时间戳可能重复。</li>\n<li><strong>running_balance 从快照的 <code>max_line_id</code> 起算</strong>，复用余额快照机制；超高活跃账户改用页内窗口。</li>\n<li><strong><code>biz_ref</code> / <code>entry_type</code> / <code>idempotency_key</code> 缺失就永久不可补</strong>，因此要有定时自检，因为定时任务与补偿逻辑最容易漏填。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账目能查清之后，下一个问题是：账本如何按时间切成一段一段并锁住，见 <a href=\"period-close-reconcile\">对账期与关账流程</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"账目溯源与账户流水","id":"账目溯源与账户流水"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条溯源方向","id":"核心概念-两条溯源方向"},{"level":2,"text":"正向溯源：业务单号到分录","id":"正向溯源-业务单号到分录"},{"level":3,"text":"biz_ref 的多对一映射","id":"biz_ref-的多对一映射"},{"level":3,"text":"溯源接口的三个必备返回","id":"溯源接口的三个必备返回"},{"level":2,"text":"账户流水：范围扫描与分页","id":"账户流水-范围扫描与分页"},{"level":3,"text":"游标分页而非 OFFSET","id":"游标分页而非-offset"},{"level":3,"text":"running_balance 的计算代价","id":"running_balance-的计算代价"},{"level":2,"text":"溯源的数据完整性要求","id":"溯源的数据完整性要求"},{"level":3,"text":"三个必须记录的业务字段","id":"三个必须记录的业务字段"},{"level":3,"text":"溯源与多阶段业务的对应","id":"溯源与多阶段业务的对应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"期末重估与汇兑损益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/balance-trial-balance/period-revalue-fx"},"next":{"title":"对账期与关账流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/ledger-query-period-close/period-close-reconcile"}}